  "body": "## 更新重点\n\n- 统一 Studio 导航栏、页面标题和列表操作，优化移动端布局。\n- 统一页面加载反馈，改进 Logo 加载动画及减少动态效果模式下的可见性。\n- 优化自定义背景和毛玻璃层次，修复窗口边缘与圆角衔接，让麦克风按钮跟随主题配色。\n- 按平台调整桌面窗口控制按钮的位置与样式，保留 Windows 原生窗口圆角。\n- Gateway 自动启动改为显式开启，Profile 列表加载不再等待 CLI 检查，并修复消息气泡首次渲染。\n- 用量统计新增费用记录与自定义模型单价，支持本地模型目录估算费用，改进模型上下文限制匹配。\n- 修复 Agent 管理器中 Cursor 图标在浅色卡片上的显示。\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix(cursor): use the product logo on Agent Manager cards by @KK-Skyline in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3222\n* [codex] record usage costs and refresh local model pricing and limits by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3226\n* [codex] unify Studio navigation, headers and mobile layouts by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3232\n* [codex] make Gateway startup opt-in and unblock page initialization by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3233\n* [codex] position desktop window controls by platform by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3234\n* [codex] refine desktop window control placement and styling by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3235\n* [codex] fix desktop theme surfaces, controls, and loading feedback by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3236\n* chore: bump Studio and desktop to 0.7.26 with localized changelog by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3237\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/compare/v0.7.25...v0.7.26\n",
